<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RPIX closes lower led by Komercni Banka.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX closes lower led by Komercni Banka.</headline>
<text>
<p>1230 GMT - Czech RPIX index closes down on Friday led by the most heavily capitalised Czech banking share, Komercni Banka.</p>
<p>* .RPIX down 12.1 points, 1.2 percent, to 997.2.</p>
<p>* Turnover, 50.8 million crowns.</p>
<p>* Komercni falls 41 crowns to 1,872.</p>
<p>* RIF rises 24 crowns to 900.</p>
<p>* SPT Telecom closes up 45 crowns to 2,999.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
